& [Waist]
  + one strict activation proposal cross-binds published code exact producer plan physical coordinates and ceilings
  + one independently admitted external decision either closes reject or yields one private affine permit
  + one consume-before-invoke bridge enters only the existing runner
  + one independent verifier converts the sealed runner receipt into terminal ceremony evidence

& [TransitionTable]
  + proposed plus valid proposal yields proposal_verified with authority0
  + proposal_verified plus supplied decision yields decision_supplied with authority0
  + decision_supplied plus admitted_reject yields terminal rejected with authority0
  + decision_supplied plus admitted_authorize yields decision_admitted with authority1
  + decision_admitted plus successful mint yields permit_minted with permit1
  + permit_minted enters permit_consumed before runner call with permit0 attempt_spent1
  + permit_consumed plus valid runner receipt yields receipt_verified and then terminal completed_available or completed_provider_unavailable
  + every invalid input or failed call yields one terminal refusal or abandoned_after_consumption with no outgoing edge

& [Verifier]
  + independently reconstruct proposal producer plan decision admission transition chain runner receipt and effect account
  + require exact raw-byte canonical forms and domain-separated self digests
  + refuse every identity order time nonce counter outcome or terminal mismatch

& [FormationFixture]
  + canonical supplied values exercise authorize and reject state projections without minting a Rust permit or calling the runner
  + redigested adversaries prove semantic refusal rather than mere stale-digest detection
  + counters remain provider requests0 remote calls0 effects0 runner invocations0 permits minted0

& [Boundary]
  + current solution is SJS meaning only; later pure implementation must publish before a private bridge or live entry route is considered
